      "problem": "${(3+2{w}^{3})}^{2}=$",
      "worked_solution": "We will use the following formula:\n\n$$\n(a+b)^{2}={a}^{2}+2ab+{b}^{2}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $a=3$ and $b=2{w}^{3},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(3+2{w}^{3})^{2} & = \\\\ {3}^{2}+2(3)(2{w}^{3})+(2{w}^{3})^{2} & = \\\\ 9+12{w}^{3}+4{w}^{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
